title: reporting changes at any depth
pid: d3ed5d37-2a37-441a-b82b-03a39a89fdf2
body: |2-
  Jeff's wish, in [[id:be02e08b-2913-447e-ae16-cf7043ec477a][how to consume subscriptions]]: if his A' subscribes to A,
  and B under A gains a child C2, the subscription to A should say so.
  Ed met the same lack in [[id:fc5df1db-2e18-4337-b8c7-7e238647b46a][consuming another's changes, as skg stood on 2026-11-12]].
  Nothing of this is built as of 2026-11-12; this is the design space.
